{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "8efa880b86b21ad5",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -40,
      "y": -40,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 200,
      "label": "Client tier",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ef37b5c18133b283",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "### Browser / PWA\nReact 19 + Vite\n\nAccess token in memory only\nSSE consumed with `fetch` + reader",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "5d3484966e99251d",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 200,
      "label": "Edge tier",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "6efd6158f1ebe816",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "### nginx\nServes the static build\nProxies `/api`\n\n**SSE passthrough \u2014 buffering off**",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "0d762fcbd0d8fa2c",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 460,
      "label": "Application tier \u2014 FastAPI (Gunicorn + Uvicorn)",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a11f31ccdd8bb9da",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 510,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "### Middleware chain\nCORS\nSecurity headers (CSP, nosniff, DENY)\nRequest id + Prometheus metrics\nStructured log line",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "1749fb3a8eaf7316",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 510,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "### Routers `/api/*`\nauth \u00b7 users \u00b7 upload \u00b7 query\nusage \u00b7 billing \u00b7 audit \u00b7 export \u00b7 gdpr\n\nOutside `/api`:\n`/health/live` `/health/ready` `/metrics`",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "63808e42820d74c4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 510,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "### nl2sql package\nintent_classifier \u2192 prompt_builder\n\u2192 llm_client \u2192 sql_validator\n\u2192 7 deterministic repairs\n\u2192 result_formatter \u2192 chart_advisor",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "9c9500d67f484a27",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "### Safety gate (defense in depth)\n**Primary:** every query connection opens with `SET enable_external_access=false`\n**Secondary:** single statement \u00b7 `SELECT`/`WITH` only \u00b7 denylist for DDL/DML and file-reading table functions \u00b7 `EXPLAIN` must bind\n\nThe self-heal path re-runs both.",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "2ea00292e0557909",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 300,
      "label": "State tier",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "f8e78924f6141a67",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "### Metadata DB\nSQLite (dev) / Postgres (prod)\n\norgs \u00b7 users \u00b7 sessions\naudit log (hash-chained)\nrefresh tokens \u00b7 usage counters",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "aa8d4ec0dcfd8184",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 360,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "### DuckDB\n**One file per `session_id`**\n\nThe uploaded dataset.\nIsolation is structural, not\nenforced by query text.",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "e74ad1fdef4f47bb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "### Redis\nConversation history\nCached schema\nLLM response cache\nRate-limit counters\n\nUnlocks `WEB_CONCURRENCY > 1`",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "e31a7a96a883a233",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "### Object storage\nS3, production only\n\nHolds the DuckDB file;\nmaterialised locally on demand.",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "1bcc8a4f3ddd63a3",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 1280,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 210,
      "label": "Inference tier",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ed0a3c13e23de054",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "### Ollama\n`llama3.2:3b` at `OLLAMA_BASE_URL`\n\nBounded concurrency \u00b7 retry with backoff\ncircuit breaker \u00b7 prompt cache",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "7ee22520c3768d8c",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1420,
      "y": -40,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 1530,
      "label": "The notes"
    },
